				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "The Bellairs SE workshops are a series of Software Engineering events held in Barbados at the [Bellairs Research Institute](https://bellairs2026.ece.mcgill.ca/location.htm) of McGill University.\nThe 2026 workshop is on [Continuous Software Engineering](https://bellairs2026.ece.mcgill.ca)."
			},
