				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Presentations are short (5 minutes). To quickly present GT and Moldable Development, we have implemented the [[Bellairs Case Study]] which analyzes the participant data of previous events from the website, to create explorable domain entities. To see this, just inspect:"
